(font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f9377c4f-642c-4f4e-b734-362479acc0c4")) (text "REF electrode -> 2 x 47k -> D510 clamp -> 4.7k -> OPA376 unity follower. REF_BUF feeds JP1-JP8 pin 3; each selected channel keeps its own 94k / clamp / 4.7k. U500 on +5VA, so it is off and clamped with the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 31.486 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a81c474c-41cb-42b9-9c0c-bdbd617e917e")) (text "ADC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 33.671 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "33f72fd9-4d69-4f4b-9d0d-151baa02bc71")) (rectangle (start 15.24 83.82) (end 206.014 124.455) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "a733dbdc-e089-4079-9dec-bffd6283a85e")) (text "BIAS output network" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 86.106 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9cb0c792-dfaa-4cdd-9977-4b6cd10d3524")) (text "RB1 + RB2 (2 x 499k) limit body current; D509 clamps the midpoint to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 89.906 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4db86a9-d34e-4f74-9fd9-0c2236adc66d")) (rectangle (start 213.36 83.82) (end 344.285 120.995) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "14b7aead-2dab-4166-aeaf-776f8cfd42ed")) (text "BIAS loop compensation" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 217.17 86.106 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ccb29891-2756-4818-8fc3-022dfced3c10")) (text "Lead-lag feedback 1M || (100k + 10 nF C0G) between BIASOUT and BIASINV for >= 47 deg modelled phase margin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 217.17 89.906 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da0014d6-3d25-47d3-85c1-3115032476af")) (rectangle (start 15.24 132.08) (end 222.638 153.74) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0b4c3bf3-d808-4e2f-bfa9-eeeac0191295")) (text "Sheet notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 134.366 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "33ccda05-daac-48e3-ac31-125eba6bba0c")) (text "REF is an electrode, not the ADC reference and not GND. It now drives only the U500 follower: channels on REF share no electrode impedance, and the REF electrode carries one leg of leakage instead of up" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 138.166 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "85bd970a-066e-4cda-ab17-2c84acfe2b62")) (text "to eight." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 140.351 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "db815cfb-c866-4238-8b3d-541128910bb2")) (text "Firmware: set BIASREF_INT = 1 in the same CONFIG3 write that sets PD_BIAS = 1; monitor BIAS_STAT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 142.536 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb2ed084-e86d-494c-9760-01f0b7011a57")) (text "Do not inject sustained overvoltage or connect a person. RB1/RB2 need pulse- and voltage-rated parts. +5VA backfeed is clamped by Q201 (analog sheet)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19.05 144.721 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff789dbc-206d-489f-989e-045220253398")))